Phase 1: MLP on two moons
  dataset: 2000 samples, noise 0.2, train fraction 0.75, seeds 20260813 and 20260814
  network: hidden [32, 32], dropout 0.1, learning rate 0.01, batch 32, epochs 60
  runs per condition: 10
  split: 1500 training, 500 validation
  running lorenz   done in 11.2 s, mean validation loss 0.1224
  running chacha8  done in 3.7 s, mean validation loss 0.1188
  written to results/phase1_runs.json and results/phase1_runs.csv
  reproducibility: repeating the first configuration of each condition
    lorenz   identical, bit for bit
    chacha8  identical, bit for bit
